"""DRAFT WORDS for the therapeutic packs. Written by Claude from general knowledge, NOT mined and NOT reviewed.
Nothing here is a number: the miner (mine.py) attaches counts from SQL to every item, and a human reviews the words before a pack's status can become "reviewed".
Regexes are RE2 (DuckDB), matched against lower-case text.

Per pack:  label, level, mesh (MeSH terms that route a design here), exclude (terms that send it elsewhere), priority (tie-break: higher = more specific),
           addon (prompt add-on, 150 words max), fields (name, label, unit, synonyms, regex), subtypes (name, regex, why),
           era (name, regex, why) = a drug class that changed standard of care, limits (what the registry cannot tell you)."""

